  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: postgresql 42.7.12.rhlw-00003",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released org.postgresql:postgresql 42.7.12.rhlw-00003 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-107314 and CVE-2026-107315.\n\nCVE-2026-107314: pgjdbc does not enforce requireAuth when the value excludes every authentication method\n\nCVE-2026-107315: pgjdbc pads a value shorter than its declared length with bytes of earlier statements (rather than zeros)\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for org.postgresql:postgresql 42.7.12 from Maven Central.",
